<div class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;">Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
For an estimate on unaccompanied baggage, please supply the following information:</span></div>

<ul>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;">Origin and destination</span></li>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;">Length, width and height (cm)</span></li>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;">Weight (kg)</span></li>
	<li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;">Description</span></li>
</ul>

<div class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;">If your request is for a domestic shipment (within Australia), all quotes and bookings are completed online <a href="https://www.qantas.com.au/qfreight/qfe/shipment-registration-wizard/global/en">here</a>.</span><br />
